</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🏠</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">格局：1房1衛</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">🏠</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">坪數：7坪</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">💰</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">租金：14000元/月（含水、網路、第四台）💰</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);\">可短租，短租須加價</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">短租租金+1000元，最短租期1個月</span><br><br>💰雜費：預收（1000）元/月，含水、電及系統服務費（續約或退租時多退少補）<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\">💰</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">管理費：450元/月</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🚫禁菸、禁寵</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🔅可報稅</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🥘可自備電磁爐電鍋簡炊</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️有共用洗衣機</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️投幣式烘衣機</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️設計美裝潢飯店套房</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️水泥隔間、符合消防法規、每房合法配備偵煙器</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️有人員定期打掃公共空間</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️家具家電齊全，一卡皮箱即入住</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">❄️有對外窗，棟距寬敞採光佳</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🚌近北車步行400M，5分鐘，南來北往都方便</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🚌後火車站、台北地下街、京站商圈散散步看電影都方便</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🚌生活機能佳！外食超easy：美食名店晴光甜甜圈、三多屋日本料理就在樓下、巷口就是7-11</span><br><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">⭐⭐歡迎預約看房成交免服務費⭐⭐</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🍀詢問約看請搜LINE&nbsp;ID加好友@540jrooq</span><br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">🍀電話(02)2550-3328<